  "identifier": "nhs-synthetic-clinical-notes",
  "name": "NHS England Synthetic Clinical Notes",
  "description": "Synthetic clinical notes dataset generated by NHS England Data Science to support clinical NLP research and model development without exposing real patient data. Contains 1K–10K UK-style clinical notes reflecting NHS documentation conventions. MIT licence enables unrestricted use for training, fine-tuning, and benchmarking clinical language models. Published April 2026.",
  "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/NHSEDataScience/synthetic_clinical_notes",
